# V-02 (borrowed owner -> views): one str-local owner feeds BOTH foreign
# views — the owner outlives every consumer (byte_length then
# scalar_count) and the verifier credential row pins the owner local;
# NUL is DATA (9 bytes / 4 scalars: A, U+0000, U+4E2D, U+1F600) plus the
# owned bystander (A, U+4E2D, U+1F600 = 3 scalars) kept live ACROSS both
# foreign calls and freed only at exit — the C runtime charge accounting
# makes a premature free observable; exit 7).
