# T-08 (V-06): TWO statically-bound provider generations in ONE session —
# query at provider bias 0, then a deck edit transitions the binding to
# bias 1 (the worker restores the OLD accepted binding first and
# transacts to the new provider; the binding generation increments).
# Both queries deliver the same reviewed oracle (exit 3504). The lease
# pinning the in-use old generation against GC and the real reclaim
# after the last release are proven by the ace-abi conformance leg
# (abi_resource939_provider_generations_lease_and_gc).
